// Application Error Analysis
// Investigate error trends, top errors, and affected users

// --- Top errors in the last 24 hours ---
AppExceptions
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| summarize Count = count() by ProblemId, OuterMessage, AppRoleName
| order by Count desc
| take 20

